## Context

`fig_regimes_scatter.pdf` (ticket 0132) must include a local 30B-class model.
`qwen3.6:35b` was added to `modelset_census_local` in PR #303 (no_think=true).
Ticket split from 0134.

## Actions

1. Check `measurements.jsonl` for which methods are already present for `qwen3.6:35b`.
2. Add missing sweeps in `experiments/experiments.toml` (repeat=3, seed=42, no_think=true).
3. Run sweeps on Ollama (serial — one job at a time).
4. Inspect output quality.
5. Update `_MODELS` in `plot_regimes_scatter.py`.
6. Regenerate `fig_regimes_scatter.pdf` and commit.

## Exit criteria

- `fig_regimes_scatter.pdf` includes `qwen3.6:35b` with all 3 methods
- `tectonic slides.tex` builds without error
